androidagent modifications (2026): separate application identity and MCP port;
native conversation interface, device metrics, bounded command execution and
per-request approval; Codex and Claude Code integration; persistent sessions,
streaming and run cancellation; app-owned embedded Termux userspace and client
setup; QEMU/Linux VM lifecycle, supervised Docker startup, project tasks,
interactive previews, diagnostic export and cleanup; direct USB UART/ESP/ADB,
SAF storage and task-scoped USB/UART passthrough; build and validation tooling.

